# Known unfixable Debian base image vulnerabilities (Portfolio bypass)
# These are OS-level issues with no upstream patch available.
# We ignore them to keep the CI green while monitoring them via the Security tab.

# gnutls: Denial of Service via DTLS zero-length fragment
CVE-2026-33845

# libssh2: integer overflow via large username or password arguments
CVE-2026-7598
